[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9725.67, "timestamp": "02:42:05", "text": "わかった。いいえ。騒音。くそ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9728.469, "timestamp": "02:42:08", "text": "これに慣れてください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9730.63, "timestamp": "02:42:10", "text": "待ち伏せ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9735.349, "timestamp": "02:42:15", "text": "うんうん。どれくらいの時間かかるのですか？えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9737.19, "timestamp": "02:42:17", "text": "音がすると、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9741.03, "timestamp": "02:42:21", "text": "停止します。音が止まったら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9746.95, "timestamp": "02:42:26", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9750.63, "timestamp": "02:42:30", "text": "よし。わかりました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9753.67, "timestamp": "02:42:33", "text": "ああ、神様。蘇生は不可能だ。もう一度始めます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9764.349, "timestamp": "02:42:44", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9767.19, "timestamp": "02:42:47", "text": "うん。ロブロックス。その雰囲気は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9778.55, "timestamp": "02:42:58", "text": "えっと、フラッシュします。実際には、一瞬の出来事だった。"}]